 "notes": [
  "EXPLORATORY, POST HOC (coordinator ruling): r2b is a sensitivity run for r2 (whose builder session was cut off by the account's 7-day usage limit). It is reported beside r2, never in its place, and never counted toward H15-H19.",
  "Written 2026-10-30 from the build's own definitions (runs/a24/zflx/r2b/exec via tools/a24_map_helper.py, workflow_*.md, system_*.md, data_types.txt) and the build's configure_end_node calls (payload ${vm} in all four workflows), before any workflow of the build was run and before any output was opened. Fixes 1-6 apply.",
  "UI flow: one page (CardDemoPage) whose cards are shown by ${screen}: SIGNON, MENU, ADMIN, ACCT, BILL, BYE. The map reads the ${vm} paths the page reads (screen, signonMsg, session.*, menuMsg, acct.accountId, acctMsg, acctView.*, bill.*, billBalance, billMsg).",
  "Start: the page opens on sign-on through a UI_EVENT (initState); CC00 and CB00 both open on COSGN0A.",
  "Page-only UI_EVENT actions (no workflow), mapped as actions with no workflow: PF3 on sign-on (BYE card with the constant 'Thank you for using CardDemo application...'), PF3 on the main menu (back to sign-on), PF3 on account view and on bill payment (back to the menu, fields cleared), PF4 on bill payment (clear).",
  "Session: the sign-on response's session.userId/userType are passed to ui_menu, as the page does; account view and bill payment take no session.",
  "Bill payment: one message value (billMsg): ERRMSG <- billMsg (fix 6 is not needed).",
  "Account view: each single value the page shows is mapped, including ACRCYCR/ACRCYDB, ACSPHN1/ACSPHN2, ACSGOVT, ACSEFTC, ACSPFLG (separate values on this page). Not mapped (combined on the page, missing): ACSFNAM/ACSMNAM/ACSLNAM (one name), ACSADL1/ACSADL2/ACSCITY/ACSSTTE/ACSCTRY/ACSZIPC (one address); INFOMSG (no info line).",
  "Menu: OPTN001-OPTN010 are the page's constant option texts ('01. Account View' ...); OPTN011 is hidden while the toggle is false.",
  "Stores: CONTRACT-UI names and types, identity field map. The build left no loader workflows: operator loaders via make-loader.",
  "Not reachable (no button): PF5 everywhere; PF4 except on bill payment."
 ],
